  "title": "Creamy Cherry Ice Cream",
  "description": "Fresh cherries are blended in a sweet and creamy mixture to make this refreshing ice cream. Amaretto liqueur adds an extra bit of cherry flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Laka kuharica - Easy Cook"
  ],
